3
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:16,200
 I, Herbert S. Sinclair, of the Mount Holly estate at Reddington, do publish and declare

4
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:25,440
 this instrument my last will and testament, and hereby revoke all wills and codicils here

5
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:27,800
 tofore made by me.

6
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:41,520
 I give and bequeath to my grandnephew, Simon P. Jones, son of my dear niece, Mary Matthew,

7
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:51,560
 all of my right, title, and interest in, and to the house and land which I own near Mount

8
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:51,900
 Holly.

9
00:01:55,400 --> 00:02:02,700
 The above provision and bequest is contingent on my aforementioned grandnephew discovering

10
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:07,840
 the location of the 46th room of my 45-room estate.

11
00:02:08,940 --> 00:02:16,300
 The location of the room has been kept a secret from all the staff and servants of the manor,

12
00:02:16,740 --> 00:02:24,500
 but I am confident that any heir worthy of the Sinclair legacy should have no trouble uncovering

13
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:27,840
 its whereabouts within a timely manner.

14
00:02:29,140 --> 00:02:36,400
 Should my grandnephew fail to uncover this room or provide proof of his discovery to the executors

15
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:41,360
 of my will, then this gift shall lapse.

16
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:52,300
 In witness whereof, I have hereunto set my hand this 18th day of March, 1993.

17
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:56,520
 Herbert S. Sinclair

